                                "sense_id": "98abb33c-b331-360b-b70a-eab2ca2b315b",
                                "text": "Yes, after a thorough perlustration of the loot that Andron and Niagarushka had obtained from the Queen's rosewood writing desk (mostly bills, and treasured snapshots, and those silly medals) a letter from the King did turn up."
                            }
